  "body": "The [spec](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#default-reader-class-definition) says this should be `{value: any, done: boolean}`, not `{chunk: any, done: boolean}`.\r\n\r\nThe code generated by this webidl file is never run, because `ReadableStreamDefaultReadResult`s are only ever used wrapped in `Promise`s, which `webidl2js` currently doesn't unwrap.",
